{"id":2234,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2234"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:57:39","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:57:39","slug":"colored-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/colored-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Colored Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"fe7a217a-3a15-4336-8da3-75db202e5bf9\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\">\n<h2 data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"451\"><strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"451\">Colored Cardboard Boxes in Custom Styles\u00a0<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"720\">Colored cardboard boxes are a bold way to showcase your brand and products. Whether you&#8217;re packaging retail goods, shipping customer orders, or preparing promotional kits, colored boxes help you stand out. They make the product look appealing even before it&#8217;s opened.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"955\">At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"747\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we specialize in colored cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Choose any color, any size, and any box style. You can also add custom printing, logos, coatings, and inserts to match your packaging goals.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1167\">These boxes come in options with lids, tuck flaps, die-cuts, and folding designs. Our colored boxes are built from premium material that holds its shape, protects your products, and leaves a lasting impression.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1265\">We offer free design, no setup charges, fast shipping, and low minimums starting from 100 units.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1304\">Benefits of Colored Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1341\">Make Your Products Easy to Spot<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1483\">Color is one of the first things people notice. With the right box color, you help customers recognize your product and remember your brand.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1615\">\n<li data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1513\">\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1513\">Increases shelf visibility<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1543\">\n<p data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1543\">Adds excitement to unboxing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1574\">\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1574\">Helps organize SKUs by color<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1615\">\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1615\">Creates consistency across collections<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1693\">Colored cardboard packaging adds professionalism to even the simplest items.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1698\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1745\">Brown Cardboard Boxes vs Colored Packaging<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1953\">While <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/brown-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1778\">brown cardboard boxes<\/strong><\/a> remain a strong choice for shipping, colored boxes are preferred where branding and presentation matter more. Use brown for bulk and colored for retail\u2014it\u2019s a powerful combo.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"4633\">\n<thead data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2386\">\n<tr data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2386\">\n<th data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Features<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2211\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2146\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2259\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2233\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2290\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2282\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2338\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2314\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2386\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2361\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"4633\">\n<tr data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2948\">\n<td data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2694\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2685\">Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2772\">Fully customizable (length, width, depth)<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2820\">Kraft, SBS, Recycled Cardboard<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2852\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2900\">Window cut-outs, Lids, Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2948\">Gifting, Cosmetics, Retail Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3232\">\n<td data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2974\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2963\">Printing<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3052\">CMYK, PMS, Black &amp; White, or No Print<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3100\">14pt\u201328pt Thickness<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3132\">Offset &amp; Digital Printing<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3180\">Logo printing, QR Codes, Barcodes<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3232\">Food boxes, Apparel Packaging, Subscription Kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3513\">\n<td data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3258\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3258\">Paper Color Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3337\">Wide range including Black, Red, Pink, Blue, Yellow, Green, White, Kraft<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3385\">Coated &amp; Uncoated Boards<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3417\">Full Surface Color Wrap<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3465\">Foil stamping, Embossing, Debossing<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3513\">Events, Promotional Boxes, Branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3793\">\n<td data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3539\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3530\">Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3617\">Tuck-End, Mailer, Sleeve, 2-Piece Lid, Die-Cut, Folding Carton<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3665\">Custom Die-Line Available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3697\">Pre-glued or Flat Pack<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3745\">Easy assembly, Locking tabs<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3793\">Display Packaging, E-commerce Orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"4073\">\n<td data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3819\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3810\">Quantities<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3819\" data-end=\"3897\">Start from 100 units, bulk pricing available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3897\" data-end=\"3945\">Bulk discounts available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3977\">Fast production<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"4025\">Repeat ordering &amp; subscription packaging<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4025\" data-end=\"4073\">Wholesale, Bulk Orders, Launch Kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4353\">\n<td data-start=\"4074\" data-end=\"4099\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4076\" data-end=\"4094\">Window Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4177\">Custom shape and placement (Top, Front, Sides)<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4225\">PVC or Eco-Window Films<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4257\">Spot UV Borders Optional<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4305\">Transparent or frosted panels<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4305\" data-end=\"4353\">Showcase items like soaps, snacks, and gifts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4633\">\n<td data-start=\"4354\" data-end=\"4379\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4375\">Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4457\">5\u20137 business days standard; rush service available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4505\">USA-wide production &amp; delivery<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4537\">Free Shipping Options<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4537\" data-end=\"4585\">Same-day proofing<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4633\">Seasonal Packaging, Urgent Projects<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"4635\" data-end=\"4638\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4640\" data-end=\"4685\">Colored Cardboard Boxes With Lids and More<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4818\">We offer various styles of <strong data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4751\">colored cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong> for customers needing premium product protection and presentation.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4838\">Popular Styles<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"5018\">\n<li data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4885\">\n<p data-start=\"4843\" data-end=\"4885\">Two-piece rigid boxes with separate lids<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4886\" data-end=\"4930\">\n<p data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4930\">Folding cartons with interlocking flaps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4974\">\n<p data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"4974\">Die-cut mailers with color-matched top<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5018\">\n<p data-start=\"4978\" data-end=\"5018\">Lid and base sets with inside printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"5020\" data-end=\"5084\">Boxes are delivered flat or pre-assembled based on your request.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5142\">Fast Shipping for Colored Cardboard Boxes Nearby<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5280\">If you&#8217;re looking for <strong data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5200\">colored cardboard boxes nearby<\/strong>, we\u2019ve got you covered with USA-based production and quick nationwide delivery.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5297\">You can expect:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5299\" data-end=\"5451\">\n<li data-start=\"5299\" data-end=\"5338\">\n<p data-start=\"5301\" data-end=\"5338\">Production within 5\u20137 business days<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5339\" data-end=\"5372\">\n<p data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5372\">Free shipping across the U.S.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5412\">\n<p data-start=\"5375\" data-end=\"5412\">Expedited service for urgent orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5413\" data-end=\"5451\">\n<p data-start=\"5415\" data-end=\"5451\">Low MOQs and repeat customer perks<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5453\" data-end=\"5522\">Reach out today for a quote and receive your boxes right on schedule.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5588\">Various Cardboard Boxes According to Their Function<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5943\">Colored boxes are only one part of our wide packaging catalog. You can explore more use-specific designs under our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-By-Functionality\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5826\"><strong data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5742\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/strong><\/a>. This helps you choose boxes based on how they&#8217;ll be used\u2014display, shipping, storage, or subscription kits.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"6005\">Each design focuses on purpose, performance, and efficiency.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6007\" data-end=\"6010\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"6012\" data-end=\"6049\">Design Support and Coating Options<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6051\" data-end=\"6182\">You don\u2019t need to start with a finished design. We offer free layout services with custom print mockups for your colored packaging.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6216\">Finishing Coatings Available<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"6218\" data-end=\"6362\">\n<li data-start=\"6218\" data-end=\"6266\">\n<p data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6266\"><strong data-start=\"6220\" data-end=\"6229\">Gloss<\/strong> \u2013 adds a shiny, reflective surface<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6267\" data-end=\"6311\">\n<p data-start=\"6269\" data-end=\"6311\"><strong data-start=\"6269\" data-end=\"6278\">Matte<\/strong> \u2013 gives a smooth, soft texture<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6312\" data-end=\"6362\">\n<p data-start=\"6314\" data-end=\"6362\"><strong data-start=\"6314\" data-end=\"6325\">Spot UV<\/strong> \u2013 highlights logos or window edges<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"6364\" data-end=\"6444\">We also support eco-friendly printing options for brands with sustainable goals.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6446\" data-end=\"6449\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6711\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6481\">Ready to place your order?<\/strong> Contact us now to get started with fully custom <strong data-start=\"6530\" data-end=\"6557\">Colored Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> that align with your brand and packaging goals. Let us help you create packaging that gets noticed, protects your products, and stays within your budget.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/article>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes has a great selection of colored cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from high-quality materials and are available in a variety of sizes and styles. We also offer a variety of printing and coating options, including gloss, matte, and spot UV. We offer free design and shipping, and our turnaround times are fast. Order Now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2331,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2234","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Colored Cardboard Boxes &amp; Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes offers Colored Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices with custom sizes, styles, and coating options. Enjoy free design, fast turnaround,\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/colored-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Colored Cardboard Boxes &amp; Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes offers Colored Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices with custom sizes, styles, and coating options. Enjoy free design, fast turnaround,\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/colored-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T15:57:39+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\